Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:24.55,Hook,,0,0,0,,SIGILO NIVEL PSICÓPATA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Hostia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:03.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vale, me atraparon, me\Natraparon, me atraparon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué te pasa, cabrón?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué, me atrapaste, güey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ya, perdón, perdón,\Nperdón… ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Deja, no quiero pegarte.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ellos me atacaron\Nprimero, güey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Yo no hice nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.87,0:00:21.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Vamos, hay que hacerlo en\Nsilencio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.33,0:00:22.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Lo siento, no sabía.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es que como tengo perfil\Npsicópata…
